---
description: WOLF rules
alwaysApply: true
---
Read and follow `AGENTS.md` (hard rules, coding rules, ship rules). Framework first: before editing code, run `bash scripts/wolf-check.sh "<task>"` and build within what it prints (the git pre-commit hook blocks code commits until it has run, and CI requires the `WOLF check:` line). Never use --no-verify, never force-push main, never read .env files, never touch env.DB outside src/db.ts.
